<title>USA: Weld County, Colo., yields 5.60 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Weld County, Colo., yields 5.60 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanifen, Imhoff Inc said it priced $7.45 million of Weld County, Colo., correctional facilities certificates of participation, Series 1997 with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2016.</p>
</text>
